Audio Duration: 2m 42.8s (162.82s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 09:58:00 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 赚钱是成年人最大的体面
Segment #2   [00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,520] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 我有很多朋友都在吞吞这句话
Segment #3   [00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,800] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 13 | Text: 确实你通往适合远方的道路上
Segment #4   [00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,120] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 5  | Text: 不仅需要情怀
Segment #5   [00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:09,080] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 8  | Text: 你还需要更多的盘产
Segment #6   [00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,180] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是除了爽多数
Segment #7   [00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,860] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 嘴里含着金钥匙出生的人
Segment #8   [00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,660] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 10 | Text: 你大部分的人他不都在经历
Segment #9   [00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,240] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 6  | Text: 房贷 车贷 教育
Segment #10  [00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,780] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 9  | Text: 然后还有医疗的经济压力
Segment #11  [00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,280] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 7  | Text: 尤其是35岁以后
Segment #12  [00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:20,140] | Elapsed:  16.75s | Words: 13 | Text: 你还适合在伴随着事业的危机
Segment #13  [00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:21,600] | Elapsed:  16.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是赚钱只是基本
Segment #14  [00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,320] | Elapsed:  16.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 还有很多责任和义务
Segment #15  [00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,500] | Elapsed:  16.76s | Words: 8  | Text: 他本来就是一个成年人
Segment #16  [00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,940] | Elapsed:  16.76s | Words: 7  | Text: 应该承担的负担
Segment #17  [00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,860] | Elapsed:  16.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 我不是在否认定钱的重要性
Segment #18  [00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,400] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是对成年人来说
Segment #19  [00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,320] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 最大的体面
Segment #20  [00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:33,100] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 14 | Text: 其实我感觉是多重身份的完美扮演
Segment #21  [00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,060] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是你上班的时候
Segment #22  [00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,560] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 14 | Text: 你用西装格履来掩饰身体的透支
Segment #23  [00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,420] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 笑脸迎接工作的焦虑
Segment #24  [00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,380] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后你在家里
Segment #25  [00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:41,800] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 12 | Text: 你不仅要扮演无所不能的父亲
Segment #26  [00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,100] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 你还得去扮演什么都
Segment #27  [00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,300] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 风轻云耐的丈夫
Segment #28  [00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,140] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 哪有无所不能的人
Segment #29  [00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:48,060] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 8  | Text: 成年人他真的是卷不动
Segment #30  [00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:49,600] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 7  | Text: 躺不平 也逃不掉
Segment #31  [00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,100] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 9  | Text: 我说大家最近有没有刷到过
Segment #32  [00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:51,740] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 3  | Text: 一个视频
Segment #33  [00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:53,040] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是一个中年男人
Segment #34  [00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:53,800] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 5  | Text: 他在面馆里
Segment #35  [00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:54,680] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 他点了一碗面
Segment #36  [00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,080] | Elapsed:  34.89s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后还有一瓶白酒
Segment #37  [00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:58,540] | Elapsed:  53.14s | Words: 12 | Text: 然后这个视频配着非常伤感的音乐
Segment #38  [00:00:58,540 --> 00:01:00,420] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 然后形容一个男人用一碗面
Segment #39  [00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:02,000] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 一包炸彩 一瓶白酒
Segment #40  [00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,920] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 就可以让他获得短暂的放松
Segment #41  [00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,400] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 9  | Text: 这个视频有100多万点赞
Segment #42  [00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,820] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 我觉得大家都能理解到
Segment #43  [00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:08,080] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是男人的不容易
Segment #44  [00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,500] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 8  | Text: 可能利用一顿饭的时间
Segment #45  [00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,300] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 11 | Text: 他就能实现就是精神危逃力
Segment #46  [00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:14,340] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 12 | Text: 每个人可能都需要用一碗面的时间
Segment #47  [00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:16,700] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 来逃离体面的社会角色
Segment #48  [00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:17,760] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 7  | Text: 也不一定是一碗面
Segment #49  [00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,320] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 10 | Text: 有可能两人吃个驴肉火烧
Segment #50  [00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:22,280] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 12 | Text: 有可能是多放点辣椒的猪脚饭
Segment #51  [00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,560] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是对我而言
Segment #52  [00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,700] | Elapsed:  53.15s | Words: 4  | Text: 没有什么压力
Segment #53  [00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:26,640] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 10 | Text: 是一顿毕春酒解决不了的
Segment #54  [00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,980] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 7  | Text: 如果说没有 那就两顿
Segment #55  [00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:29,540] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 8  | Text: 毕竟我感觉钱再多
Segment #56  [00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:30,920] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 7  | Text: 你很难活过100岁
Segment #57  [00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:33,140] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 10 | Text: 你再漂亮 你也讨好不了阎王
Segment #58  [00:01:33,140 --> 00:01:36,160] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 10 | Text: 人生苦短 只好把酒倒满
Segment #59  [00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:36,980] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 4  | Text: 这个毕春酒
Segment #60  [00:01:36,980 --> 00:01:39,380] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 7  | Text: 大家可能也非常的熟悉了
Segment #61  [00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:40,160] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 4  | Text: 我的口粮酒
Segment #62  [00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,800] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 10 | Text: 就是经常在我的视频里出现
Segment #63  [00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,560] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 11 | Text: 用着和茅台一样的十六种
Segment #64  [00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,240] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 9  | Text: 核心的君主去酿造的
Segment #65  [00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:47,280] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 10 | Text: 它的口感和老茅台非常的接近
Segment #66  [00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,020] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 9  | Text: 它不仅是寄茅台之后
Segment #67  [00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:51,500] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 10 | Text: 国家第二家酱香保密酒旗
Segment #68  [00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:53,500] | Elapsed:  71.79s | Words: 10 | Text: 去年被邀请参与制定了
Segment #69  [00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:55,260] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 酱香型白酒的国家标准
Segment #70  [00:01:55,260 --> 00:01:56,920] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 这可是酱酒圈里的
Segment #71  [00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,000] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 国家对成员之一
Segment #72  [00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,120] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 它关键它还便宜
Segment #73  [00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,100] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 4  | Text: 就是这一瓶
Segment #74  [00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:02,180] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 11 | Text: 核酸下来它才一百多块钱
Segment #75  [00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:03,340] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 不是茅台喝不起
Segment #76  [00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:05,180] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是喝自己爱喝的酒
Segment #77  [00:02:05,180 --> 00:02:06,600] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 6  | Text: 做自己想做的事
Segment #78  [00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:08,060] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 你既不给自己造成
Segment #79  [00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:08,980] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 额外的经济负担
Segment #80  [00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:11,740] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 又能短时间的去逃离体面
Segment #81  [00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:12,700] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 做真实的自己
Segment #82  [00:02:12,700 --> 00:02:13,960] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 你说咱们一直逃
Segment #83  [00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,240] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 9  | Text: 一直去妥协现实的规则
Segment #84  [00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,640] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 又追求精神的自由
Segment #85  [00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:19,100] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 10 | Text: 就像站在宁宁的道路上
Segment #86  [00:02:19,100 --> 00:02:20,040] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 你仰望天空
Segment #87  [00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,860] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 7  | Text: 虽然我们一身狼狈
Segment #88  [00:02:21,860 --> 00:02:23,180] | Elapsed:  91.82s | Words: 5  | Text: 但是眼睛有光
Segment #89  [00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:23,720] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 3  | Text: 老铁们
Segment #90  [00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,700] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 敬你们一杯
Segment #91  [00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:26,720] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 希望你们越来越好
Segment #92  [00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,220] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 愿你心宽思海
Segment #93  [00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:29,360] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 装得家过去
Segment #94  [00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,600] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 6  | Text: 也放得到未来
Segment #95  [00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:32,220] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 1  | Text: 加油
Segment #96  [00:02:34,140 --> 00:02:35,180] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 越来越好
Segment #97  [00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:35,580] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 1  | Text: 现在
Segment #98  [00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:37,060] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 酱香味非常浓
Segment #99  [00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:37,860] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 4  | Text: 入口回甘
Segment #100 [00:02:37,860 --> 00:02:38,640] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 5  | Text: 它是正宗的
Segment #101 [00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:40,640] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 10 | Text: 1298系大水困沙的工艺
Segment #102 [00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:41,980] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 3  | Text: 尝一尝
Segment #103 [00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:42,480] | Elapsed: 104.07s | Words: 3  | Text: 没毛病
